  "html": "<p>이 단계에서는 <strong>블록 두 개</strong>를 만듭니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Start ─→ 분류봇(Agent)</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<p>문의 내용을 받아서, AI가 <strong>긴급한지 판단하고 한 줄로 요약</strong>하게 하는 것까지입니다.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"start-블록에-테스트값-넣기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#start-블록에-테스트값-넣기\" class=\"peer\">Start 블록에 테스트값 넣기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><code>Run</code>은 실행할 때 입력을 묻지 않습니다. <strong><code>Start</code> 블록에 적어 둔 값을 그대로 씁니다.</strong>\n그래서 먼저 시험용 문의를 하나 넣어 둡니다.</p>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong>캔버스에서 <code>Start</code> 블록을 클릭합니다.</strong></p><p>오른쪽 <code>Editor</code>에 <code>Inputs</code> 표가 나타납니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>input</code> 줄의 <code>Value</code> 칸에 시험용 문의를 적습니다.</strong></p><figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>결제했는데 서비스가 안 열립니다. 지금 급합니다.</span></span></code></pre></div></figure><p>다른 줄(<code>conversationId</code> · <code>files</code>)은 그대로 두면 됩니다.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>나중에 이 값만 바꿔 가며 <code>Run</code>을 누르면 여러 경우를 빠르게 시험할 수 있습니다.\n지금은 <strong>긴급한 문의</strong> 하나로 시작합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"agent-블록-놓기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#agent-블록-놓기\" class=\"peer\">Agent 블록 놓기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong>캔버스에서 <code>Start</code> 블록을 클릭해 선택합니다.</strong></p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong>오른쪽 패널에서 <code>Toolbar</code> 탭을 열고 <code>Blocks</code>에서 <code>Agent</code>를 클릭합니다.</strong></p><p>앞 블록을 선택한 상태에서 클릭하면 <strong>연결선까지 자동으로 이어집니다.</strong>\n이어지지 않았다면 <code>Start</code>의 오른쪽 점을 끌어 <code>Agent</code>에 놓습니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong>블록 이름을 <code>분류봇</code>으로 바꿉니다.</strong></p><p>블록을 오른쪽 클릭해 <code>Rename</code>을 고르거나, <code>Editor</code> 위쪽의 이름을 눌러 고칩니다.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>이름은 지금 바꾸는 편이 좋습니다.</strong> <code>Agent 1</code>인 채로 두면 다음 단계에서 결과를 가져다 쓸 때\n<code>&lt;agent1.content&gt;</code> 가 되어 무슨 블록인지 알기 어렵습니다.\n지금 바꾸면 <code>&lt;분류봇.content&gt;</code> 가 됩니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"분류봇에게-일-시키기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#분류봇에게-일-시키기\" class=\"peer\">분류봇에게 일 시키기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><code>분류봇</code>을 클릭하면 오른쪽 <code>Editor</code>에 설정이 나옵니다.</p>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"model-고르기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#model-고르기\" class=\"peer\">Model 고르기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<p><strong><code>Model</code></strong> 에서 쓸 AI 모델을 하나 고릅니다. <strong>필수 항목</strong>입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>API 키를 넣는 칸은 없습니다.</strong> 모델 키는 플랫폼이 알아서 붙여 주므로 고르기만 하면 됩니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"messages-채우기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#messages-채우기\" class=\"peer\">Messages 채우기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<p><strong><code>Messages</code></strong> 에 AI에게 할 말을 적습니다. 줄마다 <strong>역할</strong>을 고를 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>System</code> 역할로 한 줄을 만들고 규칙을 적습니다.</strong></p><figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>너는 고객 문의를 분류하는 담당자다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>문의를 읽고 아래 형식으로만 답한다.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>긴급도: URGENT 또는 NORMAL 중 하나</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>요약: 문의 내용을 한 줄로</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>돈이 걸려 있거나 서비스를 못 쓰는 상황이면 URGENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>단순 문의나 안내 요청이면 NORMAL 이다.</span></span></code></pre></div></figure></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p><strong><code>User</code> 역할로 한 줄을 더 만들고, 앞에서 받은 문의를 넣습니다.</strong></p><p>칸에 <strong><code>&lt;</code></strong> 를 입력하면 쓸 수 있는 값 목록이 뜹니다. 거기서 <code>start.input</code>을 고릅니다.</p><figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>다음 문의를 분류해 줘.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;start.input&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>직접 타이핑하지 말고 목록에서 고르세요.</strong> <code>&lt;</code> 를 치면 뜨는 목록에는\n<strong>선으로 이어진 앞 블록만</strong> 나옵니다. 목록에 <code>start</code>가 안 보인다면\n<code>Start</code>와 <code>분류봇</code>이 아직 이어지지 않은 것입니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"돌려-보기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#돌려-보기\" class=\"peer\">돌려 보기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><strong><code>Run</code></strong>(<code>⌘Enter</code>)을 누릅니다.</p>\n<p>화면 아래 <code>Terminal</code>에 두 줄이 쌓입니다. <code>분류봇</code> 줄을 클릭하면 결과가 보입니다.</p>\n<p>이런 식으로 나오면 성공입니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>긴급도: URGENT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>요약: 결제 후 서비스 접속이 되지 않아 즉시 확인이 필요함</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><code>Terminal</code>에서 그 줄의 <strong><code>Input</code></strong> 탭도 열어 보세요.\n<code>&lt;start.input&gt;</code> 자리에 <strong>실제 문의 내용이 채워져</strong> AI에게 전달된 것을 확인할 수 있습니다.\n값이 비어 있다면 참조가 잘못된 것입니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"다른-입력으로도-해-보기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#다른-입력으로도-해-보기\" class=\"peer\">다른 입력으로도 해 보기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><code>Start</code>의 <code>Value</code>를 바꿔서 한 번 더 돌려 봅니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>요금제 종류가 궁금합니다.</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<p>이번에는 <code>NORMAL</code>이 나와야 합니다. <strong>두 경우가 다르게 나오는지</strong> 꼭 확인하세요.\n다음 단계에서 이 차이로 길을 가를 것이기 때문입니다.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"잘-안-될-때\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#잘-안-될-때\" class=\"peer\">잘 안 될 때</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>증상</th><th>확인할 것</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Run</code>을 눌러도 아무 일이 없다</td><td><code>Start</code>와 <code>분류봇</code>이 선으로 이어졌는지</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;</code> 를 쳐도 <code>start</code>가 안 나온다</td><td>선이 이어졌는지 — 선을 먼저 이어야 목록에 나옵니다</td></tr><tr><td>AI에게 문의 내용이 안 갔다</td><td><code>Terminal</code>의 <code>Input</code> 탭에서 값이 채워졌는지</td></tr><tr><td>형식이 제멋대로 나온다</td><td><code>System</code> 줄에 형식을 더 분명히 적습니다</td></tr><tr><td><code>Model</code>이 비어 있다고 나온다</td><td><code>Model</code>은 필수입니다. 하나 고릅니다</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>여기까지 되면 1단계 완료입니다.</strong> 다음 단계로 넘어가기 전에 <strong><code>버전 저장</code></strong> 을 한 번 눌러 두세요.</p>"
}